### 추적 링크 발급
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tracking-links
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a11",
  "partnerId": "c0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a11",
  "targetUrl": "https://demo-shop.com/product/1"
}

### 클릭 리다이렉트
GET http://localhost:8080/api/redirect/{{trackingCode}}

### 추천 코드 발급
POST http://localhost:8080/api/referral-codes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tenantId": "a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a11",
  "partnerId": "c0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a11",
  "code": "JISOO10"
}
